# The 27B (Q6_K) with the full f16 KV cache instead of q8_0: 16 attention layers, about 68 KB a token, so 6.6 GB
# at 98304 total context against 3.3 GB (the model's other buffers: weights 20.0 GB, recurrent state 0.45 GB,
# compute 0.5 GB; about 29.5 GB in all on the 32.6 GB card). The cache grows linearly with CTX.
MODEL=$HOME/llms/text-generation-webui/user_data/models/Huihui-Qwen3.5-27B-abliterated.i1-Q6_K.gguf
CTX=98304
CKPT=2048
KV=f16
